<title>UK: GOLF-U.S. RETAIN SOLHEIM CUP.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RETAIN SOLHEIM CUP.</headline>
<dateline>CHEPSTOW, Wales 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States made sure of retaining the Solheim Cup when they took an unassailable 14-11 lead over Europe during the final day singles on Sunday.</p>
</text>
